<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Spain's Banesto 96 attrib seen rising.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Spain's Banesto 96 attrib seen rising.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish bank Grupo Banesto. Simple averages of analysts' forecasts.</p>
<p>(In billions of pesetas).</p>
<p>				     1996	  1995	 RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income     132.09	133.23  127.51 - 146.53</p>
<p>    Operating income	   39.90	 28.50   39.01 - 40.90</p>
<p>    Net attributable	   30.35	 20.72   29.00 - 32.62</p>
<p>    EPS (pesetas)		    49	   34	  47-53</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Argentaria Bolsa, Beta Capital, Benito y Monjardin, Ahorro Corporacion and Renta 4.</p>
<p>Banesto is expected to release its results on January 14.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
</text>
